      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "The purpose of the `Cardano` module is to actually provide set of types which we can use easily from PureScript. The idea is that this lib should not actually introduce any higher level wrappers and work only with the underlining primitives. purescript-cardano on the other hand should wrap this layer and provide memory safe operations.",
